  recipeId: thermal
  concept: 'Authored objective: Recover three thermal faults.

    Authored requirement:
    Renew HS1 TIM, replace the stalled fan and rebuild the separate VRM heat-transfer
    span.

    General teaching principle: Thermal control depends on measured temperatures,
    loads, feedback and operating limits over time.

    Only fresh, authoritative
    game evidence can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A thermostat illustrates the need to distinguish a measured condition
    from a chosen setpoint.
